        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A rotating campaign chapter with a complete local infiltration chain.\n\n1. At your Garrison, check Khadgar's Servant for Garrison Campaign: The Sargerei. Complete any already-started campaign chapter first; only the offered weekly chapter can be continued. The next-quest entry follows this character's Sargerei chain when it becomes available.\n\n2. Take the Alliance introduction to Archmage Modera at Socrethar's Rise in Shadowmoon Valley, Draenor, or the Horde introduction's Bron Skyhorn flight. Begin Infiltrating the Sargerei at about 43.6,77.2.\n\n3. Collect the Sargerei Robe, Cowl and Slippers from cultists, combine them into the quest disguise and wear it. Speak to Soulbinder Zamaya and Anchorite Laanda. For The Word of Socrethar read The Eredar Destiny at 51.4,75.6, The Purpose of Unity at 50.0,72.4 and The Promise of Eternity at 50.6,79.6. Also destroy six Felstorm Crystals for Shattering the Enemy, recover eight Wooden Spears from the southern woods for Pesky Podlings and defeat Eldermoss at 45.6,73.8 for An Ancient Threat. Keep the disguise on when handing in.\n\n4. Complete Facing Demons by defeating Invokaz and destroying the gate. Continue Socrethar's Fury: confront Socrethar and recover the Sargerei Battle Plans from Zamaya. Turn in for the permanent toy, then take Forging Ahead back to the Garrison to finish the chapter.\n\n5. Learn Sargerei Disguise. This permanent cosmetic toy does not make cultists friendly: use the separate temporary quest disguise whenever the infiltration quests require it.",
