        sourceType = "Garrison Achievements",
        stepCount = 17,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A five-part jukebox introduction and twenty learned music rolls, including random drops.\n\n1. At a level 3 Garrison, ask Fix 'Smallie' Biggswrench (Alliance) or Drix Bassbolter (Horde) for Bringing the Bass: 38356 Alliance / 37961 Horde. Finish this before hunting music rolls; many sources are unavailable until the jukebox is unlocked.\n\n2. Collect Bass Blaster at Nagrand's Ring of Blood, 57.8,10.9 (defeat the dancing ogres); Cord of Ancient Wood from Lumbering Ancients in Gorgrond's Everbloom Wilds around 57,42; S.P.R.K. Capacitor from Iron Shredders at Mor'gran Logworks in Talador around 64.3,27.9; Phonic Amplifier from Stalwart Wardens/Glowing Energizers at Skettis in Spires around 52,11.8; and Laz-Tron Disc Reader upstairs in Pinchwhistle Point's house at 55.5,90.6 (defeat the goblin who appears). Return all five parts.\n\n3. Open the Stash of Dusty Music Rolls reward and learn its seven starter tracks. Track your faction's Azeroth's Top Twenty Tunes achievement. The following thirteen distinct rolls form a complete route from seven to twenty; skip any already learned and substitute another existing jukebox roll if needed.\n\n4. Music Roll: Magic - in Ashenvale, loot the Lost Sentinel's Pouch inside the hollow tree west of Raynewood Retreat, around 56.4,49.3. Learn the roll.\n\n5. Music Roll: Mountains - in Winterspring, loot the Frozen Supplies at the tower east of Owl Wing Thicket, around 68.0,73.9. Learn the roll.\n\n6. Music Roll: The Black Temple - enter Warden's Cage in Shadowmoon Valley, Outland, around 57.0,49.0. Go below ground and through the first portcullis; loot the Warden's Scroll Case. This is not Draenor Shadowmoon Valley.\n\n7. Music Roll: Totems of the Grizzlemaw - find Remington Brode travelling through Grizzly Hills between Ashwood Post and Aspen Grove Post. Search his long route with /target Remington Brode. Choose Breathe deeply, ask for a song, request a song about the wilderness, then accept. Learn the roll.\n\n8. Music Roll: Ghost - reach Raven Hill Cemetery in Duskwood and return there in ghost form after dying. Find Forlorn Composer wandering on the surface around 23.5,39.2 and the northeast cemetery. Stand close, ask for his song, then recover your body and learn the roll. He is not in the underground crypt.\n\n9. Music Roll: Cold Mountain - train basic Fishing and fish in Ironforge's Forlorn Cavern around 47,19 until the roll appears. Keep fishing if the first catches are ordinary fish, then learn it.\n\n10. Music Roll: Mountains of Thunder - enter Halls of Lightning beside Ulduar in the Storm Peaks at 45.3,21.6. Defeat and loot Loken; Normal is a repeatable alternative. Reset outside within the instance-entry limit if you need another eligible attempt.\n\n11. Music Roll: Karazhan Opera House - enter the original ground-level Karazhan raid in Deadwind Pass, not Return to Karazhan. Reach the Opera event, defeat that week's performance and loot its reward for the roll chance. Retry after the raid reset if absent.\n\n12. Music Roll: The Burning Legion - clear original Black Temple in Outland and loot Illidan Stormrage. The separate Warden's Scroll Case roll does not replace this boss-drop roll. Retry on an eligible weekly lockout if absent.\n\n13. Music Roll: Wrath of the Lich King - enter Northrend Naxxramas in Dragonblight, reach Frostwyrm Lair and defeat Sapphiron and Kel'Thuzad. Loot Kel'Thuzad for the roll chance; retry on another eligible lockout if absent.\n\n14. Music Roll: Legends of Azeroth - enter Blackwing Descent on Blackrock Mountain's upper exterior terrace. Clear the early bosses, then defeat Nefarian and Onyxia and loot the encounter for the roll chance. Retry after the applicable reset.\n\n15. Music Roll: Heart of Pandaria - enter Terrace of Endless Spring in the Veiled Stair, clear the encounters and loot Sha of Fear for the roll chance. Use the original raid rather than a scenario or another Pandaria instance.\n\n16. Music Roll: A Siege of Worlds - enter Blackrock Foundry in Gorgrond, complete the three wings to unlock Blackhand, then defeat and loot him for the roll chance. Learn the roll and check that your total is twenty.\n\n17. When the achievement completes, check your mail and Toy Box for Portable Audiophone and learn the reward. Your Garrison jukebox plays the collected tracks; this portable toy instead plays short random snippets just for you.",
        tips = "",
    },
