        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A random reward from a daily account-wide gift package.\n\n1. Find a player-summoned Blingtron 5000, or summon your own with the Engineering toy. It can appear wherever an engineer deploys it; the Garrison map is a convenient place to request one, not a fixed robot spawn.\n\n2. Accept and immediately turn in Blingtron 5000's daily gift quest for Blingtron 5000 Gift Package (113258). Choose the 5000 version: the daily gift entitlement is shared across Blingtron versions/account characters.\n\n3. Open the package for a chance at Photo B.O.M.B. If it is absent, return after the daily reset. More characters cannot bypass the shared daily gift limit.\n\n4. Learn Photo B.O.M.B. from your bags. You do not need to own a camera to collect the toy; to see the photobomber yourself, activate the bomb and then a S.E.L.F.I.E. camera.",
